   "source": [
    "### 5. Cross-Validation\n",
    "A 5-fold cross-validation was applied to evaluate model stability across different subsets of the training data."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "from sklearn.model_selection import cross_val_score\n",
    "\n",
    "# Evaluate model stability using 5-fold cross-validation\n",
    "cv_scores = cross_val_score(\n",
    "    model,\n",
    "    X_train,\n",
    "    y_train,\n",
    "    cv=5,\n",
    "    scoring=\"f1\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"F1 scores:\", cv_scores)\n",
    "print(\"Mean F1:\", cv_scores.mean())"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "id": "gGfSkcao5HIS",
    "outputId": "52e32d6a-f94c-4435-c58f-a6e26ac306ce"
   },
   "execution_count": 13,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": [
      "F1 scores: [0.76682877 0.75031988 0.7605006  0.75819777 0.75887435]\n",
      "Mean F1: 0.758944273838367\n"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "R-oKlx2Qg0C7"
   },
   "source": [
    "The F1-scores across the five folds ranged from approximately 0.750 to 0.767, with a mean F1-score of 0.759. The small variation between folds indicates that the model is stable. The mean cross-validation F1-score is also very close to the test F1-score (0.759), which suggests that the model generalizes well to unseen data and is not overfitting."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "sHYL4yoAg0C7"
   },
   "source": [
    "### 6. Hyperparameter Tuning\n",
    "GridSearchCV with 5-fold cross-validation was used to tune the `n_estimators`, `max_depth`, and `learning_rate` hyperparameters based on the F1-score. A total of 8 combinations (2 × 2 × 2) were tested."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "from sklearn.model_selection import GridSearchCV\n",
    "\n",
    "param_grid = {\n",
    "    \"n_estimators\": [100, 200],\n",
    "    \"max_depth\": [3, 5],\n",
    "    \"learning_rate\": [0.05, 0.1]\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "grid = GridSearchCV(\n",
    "    XGBClassifier(),\n",
    "    param_grid,\n",
    "    cv=5,\n",
    "    scoring=\"f1\",\n",
    "    n_jobs=-1\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "grid.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Best Parameters:\", grid.best_params_)\n",
    "print(\"Best CV F1:\", grid.best_score_)"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "id": "mrhKwJQ5F2cF",
