    "id": "KQcmPd5og0C8"
   },
   "source": [
    "### Hyperparameter Tuning Results\n",
    "\n",
    "GridSearchCV identified `learning_rate = 0.05`, `max_depth = 5`, and `n_estimators = 200` as the best hyperparameter combination based on the F1-score.\n",
    "\n",
    "The best cross-validation F1-score was approximately 0.765, compared to 0.759 for the baseline model. Compared to the default settings (`learning_rate = 0.3`, `max_depth = 6`, `n_estimators = 100`), the tuned model uses a smaller learning rate, shallower trees, and more trees. This allows the model to learn more gradually and reduces the risk of overfitting."
   ]
  },
  {
