    "id": "QJxyOvq5g0DA"
   },
   "source": [
    "### 13. Strengths and Limitations\n",
    "\n",
    "**Strengths:** Captures complex non-linear relationships and interactions between features, does not require feature scaling, achieves strong performance on tabular data, and provides built-in feature importance.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations:** Less interpretable than Logistic Regression, has many hyperparameters that require tuning, and is more computationally expensive to train."
   ]
  },
