   "source": [
    "### 16. Trade-offs\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Accuracy:** Good, with a high recall of 80.4% after hyperparameter tuning.\n",
    - **Interpretability:** Moderate. Similar to Random Forest, feature importance shows which features matter most, but individual predictions are harder to explain than Logistic Regression coefficients.
    "- **Computational Cost:** Higher than Logistic Regression because many trees are trained sequentially and tuning requires training multiple models."
   ]
